[url=https://discord.gg/KBKpT3jW5x][img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36715037/cb27e36afa87664b7b8ace7b6be5044c0464ac92.png[/img][/url]

Hello everyone, I'm happy to present you new update for Gamer Shop Simulator.
If you don't purchased the game before, now you have a good opportunity to purchase with [b]-50% discount[/b]! Suggestion available up to [b]22 august[/b] including.

[h3]Update - August v22.08.09.0224[/h3]
- Added templates for custom prices, now you can create your own price templates, and then use them from fast access;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36715037/bf2c3b3eec9257bdea2a83e604ad16f883fd0ebd.png[/img]

- Added new app: Promotion. There you can promote your shop, it will increase amount of buyer per day, also you can enable all promotions for maximum effect, but it cost a money that will automatically getting of from your balance;
[i]Please note, increased buyers amount will be came in your shop only at the next day.[/i]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36715037/37e0f7db71b125864992137d08c082d2b0ea128d.png[/img]

- Added new app: Fobles. That app shows top 10 most successful owners of the shops. Every game-day the statistics updates, so now you have a chance to be the most successful owner and other players will  be see you in the leaderboard;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36715037/a0a1dbad1532fb5d24f6c8d59bfbd652e2d8fed4.png[/img]

- Now you can place your goods on the warehouse, the process works the same like you placing items on the shelves;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36715037/1b3efc407bb55cbb002266bf5e7d832b1e0e4f7e.png[/img]

- Added new achievement: Successful owner. For getting that, you need to get first rank in Fobles;
- Added button in paue menu, for fast switching to the main menu;
- Increased chance of spawning rich buyers;
- Fixed some sounds;
- Reworked dumpster;

Thanks to [b]all players[/b] who playing and supporting the game, that so cool to see your interest about the game progress :)

Next game update (not fix updates) will be available in [b]september[/b].
To the next update, you can suggest your ideas, that you want to see in the game.

Also now you can purchase the bundle with two my games, if you liked my games or just want to support my in game development.

https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/27284/Ride_and_Sell/

Best Regards,
DiamosDev

[url=https://discord.gg/KBKpT3jW5x][img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36715037/cb27e36afa87664b7b8ace7b6be5044c0464ac92.png[/img][/url]

[h3]Update - June v22.06.27[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fixed bug, when you can't place items in a new areas;
[*] Fixed bug, when you can't paint the walls without purchase illumination;
[*] Reworked custom prices setting up for goods;
[*] Decreased probability of rich buyers;
[*] Fixed bug, when in new area city flickering in windows;
[/list]
Best Regards,
DiamosDev

Hello, a lot of time past from last game update, some player thought that I'm stopped supporting this game, but [b]no[/b]. I'm happy to show you new game update.
Now I'm finished this game update, and started work on a new update, some spoilers about the new patch you can see in the end of this article, also you can suggest your own ideas how to improve the game below in the comments or in our [url=https://discord.gg/KBKpT3jW5x]Discord[/url].

Also, my new game [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/1903400/Bicycle_Rider_Simulator/]Bicycle Rider Simulator[/url] in a finishing line, so don't forget to add in your wishlist.

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1903400/Bicycle_Rider_Simulator/

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36715037/983ed490a0b000685f85c0bbcb422caaca5e2fdb.png[/img]

[h3]Update - June v22.06.22.2051[/h3]
[list]
[*] New location: Home (sweet home);
[*] Added new screen with information then the day ended. In this screen you can see information about your shop. Your revenue and expenses during the day.
[*] Added shop work hours, now shop work from 8:00 until 23:00;
[*] Added button for opening the store, located in the store storage;
[*] Removed "Bills App", now all your expenses per the day will automatically taken off from your balance in the end of the day;
[*] Removed "Day skip button";
[*] Reworked opening shop system;
[*] Reworked logic of spawn buyers, thieves;
[/list]
That's all for this update, but now I want to show you some information about the future updates.
[list]
[*] City extendention;
[*] New game mechanics;
[*] Interactable storage;
[*] New tutorial for first start;
[*] Dayily tasks;
[*] and more you will see in the next updates!
[/list]
Thanks to [b]all players[/b] who playing and supporting the game, that so cool to see, that you interested in the game progress :)

Best Regards,
DiamosDev

